Subject: Recover your Origin Account

--- text/plain ---
Hello,

SourceOrigin support started a recovery of the Origin Account @ada, so its owner can add a new passkey. The account was signed out everywhere. If it is yours, open the link below and follow the steps to add a passkey.

Add a passkey:

https://auth.sourceorigin.dev/recover#token=TOKEN

The link works once, for 72 hours. If you didn’t ask for this, contact SourceOrigin support. If you still have a passkey, you can also cancel the recovery.

https://auth.sourceorigin.dev/recover/undo#recovery=RECOVERY

SourceOrigin

